msgstr "这是在 PX4IO 上监测 LiPo 电压的常用引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:160
#: 1ae6c7f4b1634d26bd8a505f9e5bded2 66f83c3d09634eab817b38e4b2f02b19
#: 6eb3c90c24c04152aecd109b19d759ed 8075f3f6b77343c0b6cb58aebc50719f
