"If using this pin then set VOLT_DIVIDER to 1 for correct battery voltage "
"reading."
msgstr "使用此引脚时，请将 VOLT_DIVIDER 设为 1 以正确读取电池电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:162
#: 1fc42cf3baf6473a9d44502abe6945a5 35b3bb246ffc46faa87d026247d865ea
#: 4f32b55760f341f1bb2f4176b6819c66 9063596573b34c92a1fe92c3dfb751a2
#: 981e320211854395860c6813015a83a2 be660a636afc4c1589bf63c987d31bbe
#: ca2c72b36681438fbeddc88ce92d2c17 f9403799a94f45babfdab6e954a77d0a
msgid ""
"Virtual \"pin\" 100's input comes only from the battery power in jack on the"
" PX4IO board."
msgstr "虚拟「引脚 100」的输入仅来自 PX4IO 板上的电池电源插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:164
#: 2c4d5518d4e4412ba41319bffaafa5ae 3757c4575f344d25848a2d34d15f19c7
#: 623e530b012741a9afd632b7790df323 99ec869e4a5b4d37bd6b43537c02095b
