" on the IO board."
msgstr "**引脚 101**：在 IO 板电源接口旁边引脚测量的电池电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:172
#: 2e862904c7a040fdb3076331209617a9 30697a295e58438ebb76b046ff118bc9
#: 3a00ac0ad43b4cea91d6a969e774871d 41f4b19b8a4446358ad81d3ac4c1f279
#: 48cfe73bfcb74cbcb1918609d543dccd 922b314f637b4cc3aae330b2a48c1df7
#: d5312456a60f422387e75e1a2a60c075 e696b735e3f44fa7802af7587c79fb44
msgid ""
"A virtual analog input pin for a battery current sensor connected to the "
"\"current\" pin next to the power connector on the PX4IO."
msgstr "连接到 PX4IO 电源接口旁「current」引脚的电池电流传感器虚拟模拟输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:177
#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:178
#: 1333da997d824021863721d757e25450 23179a9cb64f459b9002fcfee4967efd
#: 7ac2d71412474ba4b20936e7f1d1e726 7acd9c68a0424bd88e2b77f714e674b7
