#: 275f8912abdf427088ae5b37a537f857 a73ca173f1c64e04b2a3a7d94c3a45ca
msgid "Copter wiring (diagram and instructions)"
msgstr "Copter 接线（示意图和说明）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:217
#: 33fdbcfb10104b05856cb34021b0b3fb b87cf286f68b425aaad160f5b21a2fc5
msgid "**Wire the PX4-IO board.**"
msgstr "**连接 PX4-IO 板。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:219
#: 3d9c88c0dd6d4958a51276d600d0576a 8131562353d24ebabac517c2f50e2762
msgid ""
"The PX4IO board has a built in Power Supply which can connect to up to 18 "
"volts."
msgstr "PX4IO 板内置电源模块，可接受最高 18V 的输入电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:221
#: 1b743de5283c4a9b881549405e49ccf8 eab132736a1d4dafa21be19b1d7399f2
msgid ""
"Insert the white PAP-02-VS 2 pin connector with the black and red wires "
"coming out of it into the mating power connector you soldered in previously "
"on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "将带有黑色和红色导线的白色 PAP-02-VS 2 针连接器插入先前在 PX4IO 板上焊接的配套电源连接器中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:224
#: a3e11f4e811d455a98968ad576423749 f08a75b63e074214ba23faf1c87b49f5
msgid ""
"Battery Plus is the(red wire) and should be soldered to your battery red "
"power lead / connector."
msgstr "电池正极为（红线），应焊接到电池的红色电源导线/接口上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:226
#: 58c0a258cee44dc2b6f214f121a728e5 b11b9e78e5514caf95325b059e6c65bf
msgid ""
"Battery Ground is the(black wire) and should be soldered to your battery "
"black battery (Ground) lead / connector."
msgstr "电池地线为（黑线），应焊接到电池黑色电池（地线）引线/连接器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:229
#: 975b9e927f974ef4817ba5f60deb0596 ed84b01c3d17416da4c919df93a6e997
msgid ""
"**The main power inputs of your ESC's will also need to connect to these "
"wires and to a battery connector.**"
msgstr "**您的 ESC 主电源输入端也需要连接到这些导线和电池连接器。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:232
#: 2b09b3e6cca14322bf490c80157e3abf 748b96386e974da9add58e46463e1915
msgid "A Power Distribution board can also be used."
msgstr "也可以使用电源分配板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:234
#: 456195b011e646feac3fbf3da839c802 4f969b4d80bb48309282457f1982e6af
msgid ""
"**Connect your PPM-Sum RC receiver's 3 wire cable to the end of the 9 x 3 "
"angle connector that is nearest the edge of the PX4IO board with the signal "
"wire furthest from the board and the ground closest to the board.**"
msgstr "**将 PPM-Sum 遥控接收机的 3 线电缆连接到 9x3 角连接器靠近 PX4IO 板边缘的一端，信号线远离板面，地线靠近板面。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:238
#: 005cbaa5974a468a8889046fefddbaea 954114fac64f4c1ea73154971a26e1c0
msgid ""
"**Wire the PX4FMU boards servo out signals to your ESC control inputs.**"
msgstr "**将 PX4FMU 板的舵机输出信号线连接到 ESC 控制输入端。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:240
#: 17efb0daf35a40c8a53c6184ee9748ae 930306c49cde46329485629cbd926c9a
msgid ""
"Run the Signal wires ONLY from the ESCs to the 3 x 9 Servo Connector on the "
"PX4IO board."
msgstr "仅将信号线从 ESC 连接到 PX4IO 板上的 3×9 舵机连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:242
#: 79cf7236954940fc9eca5b6d5f58d087 c5f9da8662fe4f1f886b2141db9db046
msgid ""
"The PX4IO board connector for Motor 1 is at the edge of the connector next "
"to the Battery power in wires."
msgstr "PX4IO 板上电机 1 的连接器位于靠近电池电源输入线一侧的边缘处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:244
#: 6aaf908b4a4545bcaeb12edc2bccd980 e9b6e6c8f9ce4dd7917871076b26a41e
msgid ""
"Insert the Motor ESC wires arranged progressively from that edge, "
"(1,2,3,4,etc) for 2 to 8 motors depending on your copter type."
msgstr "从该边缘开始依次（1、2、3、4 等）插入电机 ESC 导线，根据机型连接 2 至 8 个电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:246
#: 79a7593cecb24ab5bc3cc8b38c139528 b4bad1061deb4866a40bcb1813bfa141
msgid ""
"You can put the ESC Signal wires into a single inline connector with the "
"correct number of pins for your copter."
msgstr "您可以将ESC信号线集中插入一个与飞行器电机数量匹配的单排接口中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:248
#: 030d54e4bebd4d65a2cddee43935666f 33f5b505972c458e900e174526adff49
msgid ""
"The ESC Signal Wires / connector should be plugged into the top row "
"(furthest from the board) of the PX4IO boards 3 x 9 Servo Connector."
msgstr "ESC 信号线/连接器应插入 PX4IO 板 3×9 舵机连接器的顶排（距板面最远一排）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:252
#: 1bd95f43b0614b31a5a03f132c5618a5 838536a0ebbf4fb88ea66708d7a7615e
msgid ""
"**Note, the cable that is supplied in the plastic envelope with the UBLOX "
"GPS which has white 6 pin connectors on both ends is not the correct cable "
"for the PX4FMU board.**"
msgstr "**注意，UBLOX GPS 塑料包装内附赠的两端都是白色 6 针连接器的电缆，不是适用于 PX4FMU 板的正确电缆。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:256
#: adbfd2be25d44ade91c9c8cf445691bd c04832f83142489983d3c6991bf8dcf5
msgid ""
"The correct longer GPS cable is provided in a separate envelope and has a 5 "
"pin \"beige\" connector on one end and a 6 pin white connector on the other "
"end."
msgstr "正确的较长 GPS 线缆单独装袋提供，一端为 5 针「米色」连接器，另一端为 6 针白色连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:259
#: 05495faaad0645aeaf5fa39192326a37 cc755f2945ea4965bde6569a797f6d8f
msgid ""
"Plug the correct GPS cable's white 6 pin connector into the 6 pin socket on "
"the GPS."
msgstr "将正确 GPS 线缆的白色 6 针连接器插入 GPS 上的 6 针插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:261
#: bb8a902c864a4d28ac86f618ef874246 c99ab38ea0da4fa99f4d3df6c96c0e40
msgid ""
"Plug the beige 5 pin connector into the PX4FMU board's 5 pin GPS socket "
"which is next to the 15 pin DF13 Mini connector."
msgstr "将米色 5 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板上的 5 针 GPS 插座，该插座位于 15 针 DF13 Mini 连接器旁边。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:264
#: 4cdaea820d2f4ef7aadf424e0e562901 5f466defebaa4fb7aa6b8e96598f080d
msgid ""
"**Plug the 2 pin connector attached to the lead supplied with the buzzer "
"into the buzzer socket on the side of the PX4FMU board that has the SD card "
"holder on it.**"
msgstr "**将蜂鸣器附带导线上的 2 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板带有 SD 卡槽一侧的蜂鸣器插座。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:267
#: 4514b99651da416394bb0288a512b577 e4ddddd6400540c2bf21b197f96a5d93
msgid ""
"**Connect the \"Arming Switch\" to the Arming switch connector on the PX4IO "
"board on the opposite side of the board from the Battery pads.**"
msgstr "**将「解锁开关」连接到 PX4IO 板上与电池焊盘相对一侧的解锁开关连接器。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:212
msgid "Archived:Rover PX4FMU/PX4IO Wiring Quick Start"
msgstr "归档：Rover PX4FMU/PX4IO 接线快速入门"
